"Walter's people build a crude jungle village and level by clearing low-star challenges."
"They beat a town boss and found a town in the jungle beside the badlands."
"A four-star basilisk shatters their town core in a flash and kills hundreds."
"Abby, a middle-aged warrior in heavy leather, leads about two hundred survivors into the badlands."
"A bladewind drives the basilisk off but kills a quarter of the fleeing survivors."
"The refugees join Aurora on provisional citizenship with a two-strikes rule."
